"facility":"Enterprise Pasadena Plant","compound":"Carbon Monoxide","pounds":60.78,"start_local":"2024-03-11T19:25","end_local":"2024-03-12T15:00","tz":"local (CDT)","cause":"The HPIB Unit tripped due to a breaker overload","match_basis":"ongoing (started 2024-03-11)","travel_h":0.17,"travel_speed_mph":11.2,"travel_distance_km":3.1,"start_to_spike_h":23.58,"arrival_local":"2024-03-11T19:35","spike_hour_local":["2024-03-12T19:00","2024-03-12T20:00"]}},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_0803","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[146.0,147.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On March 12, 2024, the Texas state monitor at HRM-3 Haden Road recorded 37.28 ppb of benzene in the 6:00 p.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.26 ppb. Wind there came from 147 degrees at 11.2 mph. 21 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. One of them, Enterprise Pasadena Plant, filed report 418744 for a release that started 2024-03-11 and, per the report, ran until 2024-03-12 15:00 local time, but the report does not list benzene, so it does not match this reading. Requested follow-up: confirm what caused this benzene reading.","draft_es":"El 12 de marzo de 2024, el monitor estatal de Texas en HRM-3 Haden Road registró 37.28 ppb de benceno en la hora de las 6:00 p. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.26 ppb. El viento venía de 147 grados a 11.2 mph. Hay 21 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. Una de ellas, Enterprise Pasadena Plant, presentó el informe 418744 por una emisión que empezó el 2024-03-11 y que, según el informe, siguió hasta el 2024-03-12 15:00, hora local, pero el informe no incluye benceno, así que no corresponde a esta lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar qué causó esta lectura de benceno.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0069_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0069","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87626,"sha256":"bd475d9466e69723b686d3e130895cc15488f62bbdbb4ee951e8e57bb034214a","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:33+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0307_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87819,"sha256":"96c47bbe3564875b6b174ff098f20622d5526f33cac8b1075008d94ba8fcbdbd","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:58:54+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_0057_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_201_0057","user_param":"45201","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88659,"sha256":"9fd0f24824bbd59b6665ecd64d00bc41e0bc4eb95664b798324d86e47830ab8c","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:17+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2024_48_201_1614_45201.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2024","user_site":"48_2